Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.52,0:02:37.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, did you hear the news?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.30,0:02:40.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're talking about it all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.44,0:02:43.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tom's violent apprentice, Kaido, is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.76,0:02:48.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was hit by the Sea Train.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.92,0:02:51.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Iceberg, listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.40,0:02:53.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.66,0:02:55.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the first apprentice of Tom,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.98,0:02:58.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the greatest shipwright\Nthe world has ever known.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.00,0:03:02.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If anybody can do it, you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.30,0:03:06.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kokoro, one of these\Ndays, let's share a drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.36,0:03:08.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know when we actually have.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.58,0:03:13.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,something to drink to yeah Tom
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.02,0:03:20.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't let you down. I'll watch\Nover your dreams. I'll protect
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.00,0:03:25.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,everything not only this town
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.42,0:03:30.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but these blueprints as well hmm
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.44,0:03:35.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a visitor, sir. He said\Nhe's a friend from years back.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:31.15,0:03:33.78,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an2\fad(478,942)\bord0\pos(958,810)\fs60\blur0.8\c&HFCFDFC&\fscx150\fscy150}Four Years Later
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.52,0:03:37.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you know anyone named Kaido Flam?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.96,0:03:39.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Franky?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.74,0:03:43.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shall I show him in, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.08,0:03:44.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.92,0:03:46.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Turn him away.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.94,0:03:56.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sure picked a roundabout\Nway of meeting me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.00,0:03:58.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.70,0:04:01.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But anyway, what's up with that\Nstrange-looking body of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.64,0:04:02.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Screw you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.58,0:04:04.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Sea Train mangled my body.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.50,0:04:07.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so in order to stay alive, I\Nrebuilt it using some iron scraps.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.80,0:04:08.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that's not the issue!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.96,0:04:10.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've heard that your\Ncompany's been contracted
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.78,0:04:12.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to build ships for the world government!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.70,0:04:14.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't tolerate you doing\Nanything to help them!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.92,0:04:15.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.88,0:04:17.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They took Tom away!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.48,0:04:22.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the weapons that\Ncaused the whole incident?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.16,0:04:24.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you forgotten who made those?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.82,0:04:29.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you have plenty of things you want\Nto say to me, but I have a few as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.10,0:04:30.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I still haven't forgiven you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.84,0:04:32.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Four years isn't nearly\Nenough time for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.00,0:04:35.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm surprised you even\Nhave the nerve to show
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.34,0:04:37.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your face around here after what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.16,0:04:40.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What'd you say government\Ntold me that you died
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.72,0:04:43.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in an accident on the\Nrailway you never came back?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.24,0:04:46.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I believed it to be true\Neven if Tom forgave you
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.26,0:04:50.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,remember this it doesn't mean\Nfor a second that I'm going to
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.16,0:04:57.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's with all the\Nsecrecy something going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.48,0:05:01.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what are these?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.70,0:05:03.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The blueprints for that old battleship?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.28,0:05:06.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't call yourself Kaido anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.58,0:05:11.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's only a matter of time\Nbefore the government targets me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.20,0:05:12.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now listen carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.02,0:05:16.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want you to take these and\Nleave this island, Franky.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.60,0:05:17.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why should I?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.66,0:05:20.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Kaido from Tom's Workers is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.86,0:05:23.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as you don't\Nuse that name anymore,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.14,0:05:25.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then there'll be no connection between us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.32,0:05:26.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Additionally,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.44,0:05:29.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if you leave the island, the whereabouts\Nof the blueprints will vanish.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.96,0:05:31.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, hold on a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.20,0:05:34.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happens if the government comes\Nafter you and you don't have them?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.28,0:05:36.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've said what I came to say. What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.58,0:05:38.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Iceberg!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.56,0:05:40.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We shouldn't see each other again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.18,0:05:41.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.34,0:05:43.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.36,0:05:45.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you want to end up the\Nsame way that Tom did?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.86,0:05:47.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang on to those blueprints.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.56,0:05:50.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're threatened and your life\Nis in danger, just hand them over.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.56,0:05:54.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if you don't want to do that, you\Ncan burn them right before their eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.78,0:05:59.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you were me, would you\Ndo that? Tom had achieved.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.16,0:06:02.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so many wonderful things\Nbut he gave up everything
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.42,0:06:05.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To keep these blueprints\Nhidden from the world as
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.40,0:06:08.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,long as the risk remains\Nthat a woman named Nico Robin
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.26,0:06:10.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,can figure out how to\Nrestore the weapon then the
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.80,0:06:13.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,world needs these blueprints\NTo be able to fight back
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.60,0:06:17.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if i continue to keep them\Nwith me even if they threaten
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.82,0:06:20.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my life i won't hand them\Nover to the government.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.88,0:06:21.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.32,0:06:23.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.40,0:06:24.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if I decide to build it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.00,0:06:27.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you really think that you can trust me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.26,0:06:28.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm giving them to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.08,0:06:31.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doesn't that answer your question?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.10,0:06:32.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We never change, do we?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.38,0:06:36.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every time we meet face to face,\Nwe yell and argue with each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.98,0:06:38.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't forgive you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.62,0:06:41.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you may feel the\Nsame way about me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.74,0:06:44.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Franky, I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.22,0:06:47.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm really...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.92,0:06:51.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad that you're still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.68,0:07:01.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.10,0:07:03.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to leave this island!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.84,0:07:05.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got that ice for brains!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.62,0:07:07.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to do whatever\Nthe hell I want to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.82,0:07:09.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think I'm going to\Ndo what you tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.50,0:07:11.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd rather die! Understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.26,0:07:16.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it, Flunky!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:17.46,0:07:23.21,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.8\fad(478,0)\3c&H211E1C&\c&H211E1C&\bord2.5\1a&HFF&\fscx125\fscy125\t(436,478,\1a&H00&)\pos(960,740)}Bingo
Dialogue: 2,0:07:17.46,0:07:23.21,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.8\fad(478,0)\c&HE6E6E5&\bord0\fscx125\fscy125\pos(960,740)}Bingo
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.04,0:07:25.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've heard that Tom was\Nan excellent craftsman
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.70,0:07:28.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and a creative genius but he was also an
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.18,0:07:30.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,uncontrollable fish man\Nwith superhuman strength
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.82,0:07:33.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,when we ask the citizens\Nhere about him they don't
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.46,0:07:36.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,really have much to say\Nit must be difficult to
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.84,0:07:40.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,apprentice under a man\Nlike that right Cutty Flam
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.24,0:07:43.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that ridiculous question\Ndoesn't even deserve a
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.40,0:07:47.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,reply you government goons are\Nall piles of crap? Easy! Easy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.92,0:07:50.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,During that incident, more\Nthan a hundred people,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.30,0:07:54.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,including Marines and Navy officers,\Nwere severely injured here in Water 7.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.60,0:07:56.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the culprit behind it was you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.22,0:08:01.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Causing the world government that\Nmuch trouble is a serious crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.46,0:08:05.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But because you were confirmed dead in\Na C-train accident later that same day,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.62,0:08:08.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all of the charges\Nagainst you were annulled.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.36,0:08:12.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since you're actually still alive, you'll\Nbe taken to Eni's lobby as a criminal.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.68,0:08:16.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There, you can take your time\Nanswering this one simple question.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.32,0:08:21.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are the secret blueprints for\Nthe ancient weapon known as Pluton?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.08,0:08:23.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, Bruno... Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.92,0:08:26.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was just able to get a connection.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.68,0:08:32.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I reported our latest findings\Non this case to our superior,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.58,0:08:36.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he said that he wanted to speak\Nwith you directly and immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.22,0:08:37.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Superior, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.86,0:08:43.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, Chief, go\Nahead. Hot! Hot! Ouch! Out!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.50,0:08:45.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I spilled coffee all over myself, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.62,0:08:47.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stupid coffee!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.84,0:08:50.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the heck?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.48,0:08:52.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, you're still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.54,0:08:54.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Greetings, Cutty Flam.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.70,0:08:57.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Long time no see.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:55.85,0:09:02.73,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an2\fad(477,0)\fs90\pos(960,670)\1a&HFF&\blur0.8\bord2.5\3c&H0E0E11&}{Enies Lobby\NCommand Center-OG}Command Center\NEnies Lobby{PP}
Dialogue: 2,0:08:55.85,0:09:02.73,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an2\fad(477,0)\fs90\bord0\blur0.8\pos(960,670)}{Enies Lobby\NCommand Center-OG}Command Center\NEnies Lobby{PP}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.10,0:09:01.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's hard to believe you somehow\Nmanaged to survive the accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.92,0:09:06.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hard to believe, but\Ngood news nonetheless.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.98,0:09:10.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nevertheless, for the past eight\Nyears, every time my scars hurt,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.40,0:09:12.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was tormented by an\Nunquenchable anger that
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.00,0:09:15.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't take the proper\Nvengeance I deserved.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.28,0:09:20.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because the criminal responsible\Nfor those scars was dead, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.98,0:09:23.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.36,0:09:24.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.94,0:09:26.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you remember me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.22,0:09:33.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the man from Cipher pool number\Nfive that arrested Tom's workers when I
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.06,0:09:38.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,caught them red-handed for savagely\Nattacking the judicial ship eight years ago
Dialogue: 1,0:09:35.26,0:09:38.77,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an2\fad(482,0)\fs100\pos(960,650)\bord3.2\1a&HFF&\blur0.8}{Chiper Pol No. 9\NDirector Spandam-OG\3c&H252425&}Chief Spandam\NCipher Pol No. 9{WF+PP}
Dialogue: 2,0:09:35.26,0:09:38.77,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an2\fad(482,0)\fs100\bord0\blur0.8\pos(960,650)}{Chiper Pol No. 9\NDirector Spandam-OG}Chief Spandam\NCipher Pol No. 9{WF+PP}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.14,0:09:44.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're that Spandam guy,\Naren't you? Spandam!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.26,0:09:45.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're missing the M!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.88,0:09:49.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'll have plenty of time to drill that
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.18,0:09:51.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,into your head once you\Narrive at Eni's lobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.30,0:09:53.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make it quick, men!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.14,0:09:56.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm simply dying to teach\Nthat criminal a lesson!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.04,0:10:04.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn stupid lamp.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.08,0:10:06.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tie him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.92,0:10:12.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey punk, watch those hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.64,0:10:13.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.34,0:10:25.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let him go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.58,0:10:27.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.49,0:10:28.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come back here, you bastards!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.48,0:10:35.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.92,0:10:36.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.83,0:10:39.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're not gonna help,\Nthen don't get my hoops up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.84,0:10:42.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wade, I know you, don't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.50,0:10:44.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're part of the Straw Hat crew.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:48.38,0:10:54.47,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an2\fad(1936,0)\fs90\pos(960,750)\1a&HFF&\blur0.8\bord3.2\3c&H17171F&}{Galley La Company\NHeadquarters-OG}Headquarters\NGalley-La Company{PP}
Dialogue: 2,0:10:48.38,0:10:54.47,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an2\fad(1936,0)\fs90\bord0\blur0.8\pos(960,750)\c&HE6E6E6&}{Galley La Company\NHeadquarters-OG}Headquarters\NGalley-La Company{PP}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.96,0:10:51.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So good!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.92,0:10:53.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The wind is too strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.42,0:10:54.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's getting worse!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.54,0:10:57.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If Iceberg's in there,\Nwe've got to get him out!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.24,0:10:58.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.94,0:11:16.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Iceberg!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.85,0:11:17.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Paulie!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.70,0:11:26.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami, oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.98,0:11:29.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to treat her right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.96,0:11:31.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I can just...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.16,0:11:43.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.07,0:11:44.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They need first aid.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.99,0:11:45.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're burned all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.90,0:11:47.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what are we going\Nto do with this reindeer?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.84,0:11:48.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.75,0:11:50.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's saying they're lies. You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.04,0:11:52.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, someone give me a hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.66,0:11:58.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.00,0:12:03.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's just sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.42,0:12:10.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what you're saying is\Nthat you left the Straw Hats,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.88,0:12:12.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but you haven't given\Nup your life of crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.96,0:12:14.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.94,0:12:19.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're a pirate, you're\Ncoming with us, Kalifa. Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.00,0:12:29.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And as for this ship, you still\Nhaven't disposed of it? Stay away!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.56,0:12:31.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare touch her!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.02,0:12:42.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you listening to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.10,0:12:44.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.02,0:12:51.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if it was only a temporary disguise,\Nwe are still respected as shipwrights.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.18,0:13:00.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When we say your ship's done for, then\Nyou would do well to listen to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.64,0:13:02.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do you care?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.92,0:13:04.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not even your ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.32,0:13:06.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can do whatever I want with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.16,0:13:08.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This lever releases the water, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.88,0:13:09.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cut it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.86,0:13:11.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not funny, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.72,0:13:25.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.76,0:13:27.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let her fall!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.00,0:13:42.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.24,0:13:45.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll carry everyone for\Na little bit longer.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:06.70,0:14:11.54,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an2\fad(480,0)\fs90\pos(960,750)\1a&HFF&\blur0.8\bord3.5\3c&H17171F&}{Galley La Company\NHeadquarters-OG}Headquarters\NGalley-La Company{PP}
Dialogue: 2,0:14:06.70,0:14:11.54,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an2\fad(480,0)\fs90\bord0\blur0.8\pos(960,750)\c&HECECEC&}{Galley La Company\NHeadquarters-OG}Headquarters\NGalley-La Company{PP}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.72,0:14:21.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You idiot, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.18,0:14:28.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.84,0:14:30.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is there anything we can do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.52,0:14:40.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look! Mr. Iceberg's awake!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.64,0:14:44.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, he's safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.44,0:14:45.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew he'd make it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.56,0:14:51.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That reindeer saved\Nhis life! Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.64,0:14:54.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought it belonged to the Straw Hacks!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.48,0:14:59.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.76,0:15:02.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This woman's from the Straw Hats, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.08,0:15:06.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, what now?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.46,0:15:08.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think maybe we should\Ntie her up and question her?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.98,0:15:09.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.89,0:15:10.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's just a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.86,0:15:11.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And she's hurt, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.00,0:15:13.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.56,0:15:15.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.47,0:15:16.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't be moving yet, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.46,0:15:17.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Iceberg!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.46,0:15:23.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, men, but I need a\Nlittle space right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.14,0:15:27.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is to say, I want to\Nspeak to this woman in private.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.84,0:15:40.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wonder what those two are talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.60,0:15:41.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Beats me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.52,0:15:44.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was that for?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.78,0:15:46.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop standing there and give me a hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.02,0:15:48.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know Iceberg and Paulie are sick,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.84,0:15:51.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but the rest of the Foreman\Nmight still be trapped inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.30,0:15:53.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he's right. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.54,0:15:55.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, but yeah, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.40,0:16:02.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, first off, I must apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.36,0:16:05.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I falsely accused your entire crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.66,0:16:07.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll try to clear that up soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.96,0:16:12.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But for now, I want to\Ntalk about Nico Robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.46,0:16:14.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.38,0:16:17.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you first came to Water 7?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.54,0:16:18.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did she start acting strangely?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.06,0:16:20.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, she did.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.70,0:16:24.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She went into town that day\Nand then never came back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.14,0:16:29.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the next morning, she was the prime\Nsuspect in your attempted murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.72,0:16:32.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When Sanji and Chopper\Nfinally saw her again,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.64,0:16:36.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,she said this was goodbye and wouldn't\Nbe a part of the crew anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.88,0:16:39.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, none of that\Nmade any sense to us,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.32,0:16:42.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so we decided to break into\Nyour mansion in hopes that we'd
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.50,0:16:45.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,be able to see her one more\Ntime and find out the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.16,0:16:48.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did it to make my wish come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.24,0:16:51.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One that can't happen as\Nlong as we're together.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.46,0:16:53.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you can't accept that, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.30,0:16:57.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What kind of wish would\Nforce her to give up all
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.68,0:17:01.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of her friends I think I\Nknow the answer actually
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.58,0:17:10.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This probably started shortly after you\Nlost sight of her for the first time
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.06,0:17:16.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cape the government had begun its\Noperation the moment she arrived
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.14,0:17:20.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In other words there's a\Ngood reason why your friend
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.52,0:17:24.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,did what she did But before\NI go into the details,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.42,0:17:27.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want you to understand that both\NNico Robin and I have the means to
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.60,0:17:31.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,revive an ancient weapon that is\Ncapable of destroying the entire world.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.48,0:17:34.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A weapon? That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.52,0:17:39.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.76,0:17:41.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've hit a snag in the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.40,0:17:44.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone head to the bedroom immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.62,0:17:47.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't shoot Iceburg yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.02,0:17:51.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you understand now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.60,0:17:54.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The blueprints that they found are fake.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.02,0:17:58.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.44,0:18:02.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would rather die than hand over\Nthat information to the government.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.18,0:18:03.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But now it's not that simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.02,0:18:06.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you've decided that\Nyou're going to help them,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.26,0:18:08.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and you're searching for\Nthe Poneglyphs yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.70,0:18:11.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then I have to do everything\NI can to stop you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.80,0:18:14.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I understand your concern,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.68,0:18:18.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I'm only studying the Poneglyphs to\Nlearn more about the history of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.90,0:18:20.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care about the weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.60,0:18:23.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to take responsibility!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.04,0:18:30.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you this would\Nhappen, but you don't listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.40,0:18:37.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Franky, even if you weren't trying\Nto, weapons are made to hurt people.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.84,0:18:41.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whether you want them to or\Nnot, they can hurt your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.04,0:18:47.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if you don't have malicious intent,\Nyour actions can still hurt people.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.68,0:18:51.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If your curiosity for history leads\Nto the destruction of the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.62,0:18:54.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then you're better off dying\Nright here and right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.92,0:18:55.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nico Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.48,0:19:00.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even after seeing what happened\Nto the devils of Ohara,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.40,0:19:02.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you still want to walk this path?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.46,0:19:05.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't know a damn thing about Ohara!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.64,0:19:10.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have no idea how much the world\Ngovernment has warped my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.72,0:19:11.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.58,0:19:16.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you hate the government\Nso much, then why help them?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.40,0:19:22.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because I have a wish that I\Nwould sacrifice anything for.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.76,0:19:33.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I came to this town, CP9\Npresented me with two conditions.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.08,0:19:38.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The first was to pin your assassination\Non the Straw Hats and leave their crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.78,0:19:42.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The second was to turn\Nmyself over to the government
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.02,0:19:45.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and follow their every\Norder without question.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.30,0:19:48.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You realize they won't let you live.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.72,0:19:50.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You escaped them for 20 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.08,0:19:53.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would you agree to\Nsomething like that now?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.64,0:19:56.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In this particular instance,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.14,0:20:02.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cape has been given permission to activate\Na Buster Call against the Straw Hats.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.48,0:20:03.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A Buster Call?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.44,0:20:07.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's an emergency order\Nthat summons five Vice.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.54,0:20:10.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,-Admirals and ten battleships\Nto the same location.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.08,0:20:15.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter how strong you\Nare, no one can survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.64,0:20:18.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a full-scale military\Nattack of that caliber
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.24,0:20:23.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,under normal circumstances only the\Nthree admirals and the head of the
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.18,0:20:26.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,navy the fleet admiral are allowed\Nto exercise that kind of authority
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.94,0:20:33.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,however this is a special case just\Nthis once admiral aokiji has given
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.92,0:20:38.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,cp9 the right to make the call when\Ni heard his name i surrendered.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.84,0:20:40.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I hadn't agreed to their conditions,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.62,0:20:43.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then me and the rest of the straw\Nhats would have been annihilated.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.00,0:20:48.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the past 20 years, I've been able to\Nrun away and survive, no matter what the
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.88,0:20:50.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,circumstance.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.79,0:20:52.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's only because I\Nhad nothing to protect.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.96,0:20:56.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because I was willing to betray\Nothers and use them as a shield.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.48,0:20:57.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But not now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.86,0:21:01.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the first time in all\Nthese years, I can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.50,0:21:06.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, they picked up the life I gave up on,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.72,0:21:12.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,returned the heart I lost, and continued\Nthe dreams that I no longer believed in.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.68,0:21:19.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even after all I've done, I've found\Nfriends who will still believe in me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.18,0:21:21.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.42,0:21:23.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But then what is your wish?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.22,0:21:29.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That excluding me all\Nof the other Straw Hat
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.08,0:21:30.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,pirates will be allowed\Nto leave this island.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.98,0:21:36.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Safely and as long as\Nyou have that you don't
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.84,0:21:39.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,care what happens to\Nthe rest of the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.94,0:21:43.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't! I've heard all that. I can take!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.22,0:21:54.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the end I couldn't pull the trigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.98,0:22:04.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She was willing to sacrifice the\Nlives of everyone in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.64,0:22:05.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even her own.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.02,0:22:08.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as she could save the six of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.46,0:22:12.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She was protecting us.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.40,0:22:16.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As much as I hate to admit it, I\Nhave no right to criticize her.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.54,0:22:19.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If they find the blueprints\Nnow, it's all my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.64,0:22:27.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.56,0:22:33.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm happy, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.36,0:22:34.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was so worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.20,0:22:37.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't want to believe she betrayed us.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.06,0:22:42.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gotta find everyone\Nelse and let them know.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.78,0:22:44.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Iceburg. Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.92,0:22:45.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you going to do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.98,0:22:48.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Straw Hats have already lost to CP9
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.72,0:22:50.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean we lost?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.74,0:22:52.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We haven't even started fighting yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.66,0:22:55.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We wouldn't be here right\Nnow if we gave up that easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.14,0:22:58.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy will get Robin back, you'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.86,0:23:01.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We just needed motivation, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.22,0:23:05.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that we know Robin needs saving?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.80,0:23:08.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no limit to\Nwhat we can accomplish.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.44,0:23:13.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.44,0:23:14.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great news!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.82,0:23:16.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Chopper! Wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.76,0:23:18.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to find everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.66,0:23:20.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can sleep when you're dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.10,0:23:23.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We gotta get moving before\Nthey take Robin away for good!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.68,0:23:27.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Chopper.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.14,0:23:30.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go meet up with Luffy\Nand the others and tell
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.40,0:23:32.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,them everything that happened\Nbetween us and Robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.84,0:23:35.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want you to\Nleave out a single word.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.84,0:23:39.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As for me, let's just say I have a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.14,0:23:41.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll try to be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.58,0:23:42.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll meet up later.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.06,0:23:48.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.72,0:23:52.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think Robin\Ndoesn't like us anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.98,0:24:00.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chopper, let me share a secret with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.64,0:24:09.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When a woman tells a lie,\Na real man forgives her.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:11.14,0:24:16.60,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an2\fad(477,479)\fs90\pos(960,670)\1a&HFF&\blur0.8\bord3\3c&H161313&}{Water Seven\NBlue Station-OG}Blue Station\NWater Seven{PP}
Dialogue: 2,0:24:11.14,0:24:16.60,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an2\fad(477,479)\fs90\bord0\blur0.8\pos(960,670)}{Water Seven\NBlue Station-OG}Blue Station\NWater Seven{PP}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.16,0:24:16.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Attention, all passengers boarding\Ntoday's final service to Enies Lobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.52,0:24:17.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Due to the current water level,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.92,0:24:20.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we will be departing from the\Nplatform on the second floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.66,0:24:22.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boarding time is 11 p .m.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.02,0:24:25.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go see who they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.50,0:24:26.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.22,0:24:32.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a top-secret\Noperation we'll run in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.52,0:24:35.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The agents must board in private. No fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.70,0:24:45.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How considerate of you to\Nfinally turn yourself in.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.10,0:24:48.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Twenty years is a long time to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.96,0:25:02.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bingo.

